@Car_Rental_System_BE_HostAddress = http://localhost:3000

### Root redirect to Swagger
GET {{Car_Rental_System_BE_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### Home endpoint (redirects to Swagger UI)
GET {{Car_Rental_System_BE_HostAddress}}/home
Accept: application/json

### Home status endpoint
GET {{Car_Rental_System_BE_HostAddress}}/home/status
Accept: application/json
